## Local preview server

Cursor auto-starts the site at **http://127.0.0.1:3000** when the `miozuki-web` folder opens. Ting does not start it herself.

**Agents (Cursor):**

- **Never** run `npm run dev` directly.
- **Never** `taskkill` or stop all `node` processes to fix preview.
- If preview says connection refused and reopening the project does not help, run **`npm run dev:restart`** once.
- Only one dev server may own port 3000. A second server (from an agent or Codex) causes connection refused or silent fallback to port 3001.

Debug log (Ryo only): `.next/dev/cursor-start.log`

